{"title": "Zariel", "pageid": 6366, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Zariel", "categories": ["Mentioned characters", "Fiends", "Archdevils"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Zariel</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Zariel_MTG.webp\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Zariel MTG.webp\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Zariel_MTG.webp/300px-Zariel_MTG.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Zariel_MTG.webp/300px-Zariel_MTG.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Zariel_MTG.webp/600px-Zariel_MTG.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Zariel MTG.webp\" width=\"270\" height=\"361\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hometown\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Hometown</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Avernus\" title=\"Avernus\">Avernus</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Nine_Hells\" title=\"Nine Hells\">Nine Hells</a></div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fiend\" title=\"Fiend\">Fiend</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Archdevil</div>\n</div></section></aside>\n\n<b>Zariel</b> is a fallen angel and the archdevil ruler of <a href=\"/wiki/Avernus\" title=\"Avernus\">Avernus</a>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> the first layer of the Nine Hells. \n\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 80px; height: 80px; clip-path: xywh(0 0 100% 100% round 15%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Book_Generic_I_Image.png/80px-Book_Generic_I_Image.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Book_Generic_I_Image.png/120px-Book_Generic_I_Image.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Book_Generic_I_Image.png/160px-Book_Generic_I_Image.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Book_Generic_I_Image.png/80px-Book_Generic_I_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Book_Generic_I_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">She invaded Avernus, was defeated, and now rules there, corrupt and wicked.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Lessons_for_Sensible_Living_XII:_Zariel%27s_Fall\" title=\"Lessons for Sensible Living XII: Zariel's Fall\">Lessons for Sensible Living XII: Zariel's Fall</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>While Zariel herself is not encountered in the game, the party typically must deal with her servants <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/25px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/38px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/50px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mizora\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png/25px-Portrait_Mizora.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/77/Portrait_Mizora.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\">Mizora</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cirrus\" title=\"Cirrus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png/30px-Portrait_Cirrus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png/45px-Portrait_Cirrus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png/60px-Portrait_Cirrus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cirrus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png/30px-Portrait_Cirrus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cirrus\" title=\"Cirrus\">Cirrus</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Feena\" title=\"Feena\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Feena.png/30px-Portrait_Feena.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Feena.png/45px-Portrait_Feena.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Feena.png/60px-Portrait_Feena.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Feena\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Feena.png/30px-Portrait_Feena.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Portrait_Feena.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Feena\" title=\"Feena\">Feena</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Anders\" title=\"Anders\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png/25px-Portrait_Anders.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png/38px-Portrait_Anders.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png/50px-Portrait_Anders.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Anders\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png/25px-Portrait_Anders.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Anders\" title=\"Anders\">Anders</a> because <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/38px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/50px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/25px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a> was one of Zariel's prized soldiers, and is now hunted by Zariel's henchmen. Zariel and her history are also mentioned in several books and notes throughout the game.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling\" title=\"Tiefling\">Tieflings</a> of her bloodline, the <a href=\"/wiki/Zariel_tiefling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Zariel tiefling\">Zariel tieflings</a>, are empowered with martial strength and can channel searing flames.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>When Zariel was still a <a href=\"/wiki/Celestial\" title=\"Celestial\">celestial</a>, she was tasked with monitoring the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Blood_War\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blood War\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Blood_War\">Blood War</a></span>. She took it upon herself to take action and led an unsuccessful invasion of Avernus. She was defeated and corrupted into becoming an archdevil by <a href=\"/wiki/Asmodeus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Asmodeus\">Asmodeus</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> She is credited with killing a horde of <a href=\"/wiki/Yeenoghu\" title=\"Yeenoghu\">Yeenoghu's</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll\" title=\"Gnoll\">gnolls</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_characters\">Related characters</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Anders\" title=\"Anders\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png/30px-Portrait_Anders.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png/45px-Portrait_Anders.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png/60px-Portrait_Anders.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Anders\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png/30px-Portrait_Anders.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Portrait_Anders.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Anders\" title=\"Anders\">Anders</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cirrus\" title=\"Cirrus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png/30px-Portrait_Cirrus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png/45px-Portrait_Cirrus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png/60px-Portrait_Cirrus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cirrus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png/30px-Portrait_Cirrus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Portrait_Cirrus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cirrus\" title=\"Cirrus\">Cirrus</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Feena\" title=\"Feena\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Feena.png/30px-Portrait_Feena.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Feena.png/45px-Portrait_Feena.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Feena.png/60px-Portrait_Feena.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Feena\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Portrait_Feena.png/30px-Portrait_Feena.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Portrait_Feena.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Feena\" title=\"Feena\">Feena</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/30px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/45px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/60px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/30px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach\" title=\"Karlach\">Karlach</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=